@submissionApi = http://localhost:5000
@pingApi = http://localhost:5200
@repositoryUrl = https://github.com/example/PingSignalR

### 1. Submission API health
GET {{submissionApi}}/

### 2. List assignments
GET {{submissionApi}}/api/assignments

### 3. Create a valid submission; keep the returned Location header
# @name createSubmission
POST {{submissionApi}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "{{repositoryUrl}}"
}

### 4. After five seconds, GET the Location returned by createSubmission; expected status: graded
GET {{submissionApi}}{{createSubmission.response.headers.Location}}

### 5. Missing required submission data
POST {{submissionApi}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Assignment does not exist
POST {{submissionApi}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "{{repositoryUrl}}"
}

### 7. Submission resource does not exist
GET {{submissionApi}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Submission SignalR negotiate
POST {{submissionApi}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Incorrect SignalR hub path
POST {{submissionApi}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Ping API health
GET {{pingApi}}/

### 11. Ping SignalR negotiate
POST {{pingApi}}/hubs/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
